WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:04.295
In this world...

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:10.051
there are Sorcerers who have
the Magic to undo others' Magic.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.304
Chota!

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:14.806
En!

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.019
En! Oh, it's you!

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.979
I missed you so much.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.524
Leaving your Partner
locked up in here like this.

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:28.194
Uh, yeah. Sorry Chota.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.905
-He's your Partner?
-As if.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:36.036
Oh dear, Noi was turned into a lizard man?

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.079
That's okay, leave it to me.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.833
This Magic is Transformational, Level C.
Impure.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.545
We'll need dirt from Hell,
the horns of a Devil,

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:49.382
and 666 types of flower seeds.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:55.180
And most importantly, the entrails
of the person dearest to Noi.

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:56.931
How romantic is that?

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.517
Dearest to Noi?

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:02.145
Must be either you or me.

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:06.191
Your entrails are hanging out,
so you do it.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:09.360
Excuse me.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:12.363
Mix them all up and put them in a mold.

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.115
Fit them together.

00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:17.368
Et voilà! A magic doll.

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:20.705
Now eat up,&nbsp;Noi.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:25.919
Shin, put your hand on Noi's chest
and think about your dearest memory.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:27.629
Dearest memory?

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:30.590
My dearest memory with Noi...

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:35.011
One time when we first started,
we got beaten up really bad,

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.889
and we fell from a cliff together
on the way home.

00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:43.144
And finally, a bit of Magic.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:03.665
Huh...? Senpai?

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:10.046
What happened to you?
Let me fix that right away!

00:02:10.547 --> 00:02:13.967
Wait, Noi! Put this on first.

